  "description": "Here's a 5-line summary:\n\n1. The original `KnowledgeSettings.vue` was a large monolithic component handling search, indexing, file management, and ignore patterns all in one file.\n2. It was refactored into 6 focused components: `KnowledgeSettings.vue`, `KnowledgeSearch.vue`, `KnowledgeIndex.vue`, `KnowledgeIndexStats.vue`, `KnowledgeFileList.vue`, and `KnowledgeIgnorePatterns.vue`.\n3. The parent `KnowledgeSettings.vue` was kept as the sole orchestrator responsible for all API calls and state management.\n4. Data flows down via **props** and user actions bubble up via **emits**, keeping child components stateless except for their own local UI state.\n5. Internal UI state (e.g. file filter, selection, ignore input) was kept locally in the relevant child components to avoid unnecessary coupling.",
